# palm pilot (2026-11-21): participants' palm photos and labels stay in ~/LENSIQ-field/palm-pilot/, never in git.
# `git add -f` bypasses these lines; tools/pii-scan.mjs forbidden-path rules are the control (tests/unit/pii-palm-labels.test.js)
# character classes keep the lines case-insensitive where core.ignoreCase is false (Linux CI)
